  "storyId": "main_1_level_main_01-07_end",
  "groupId": "main_1",
  "stageId": "main_01-07",
  "title": "The Tyrant",
  "storyCode": "1-7",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9cf684066ab26e8211f8dd761665653c9719a4c4aa4c2ba33ec57e07307f7055",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "*gasp* *gasp*...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "We made it...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "We've not only managed to shake off Reunion...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "...but the Catastrophe is also visibly weakening!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "But we're still in a terrible situation... Everyone, continue to exercise caution!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "The Catastrophe...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "The streets are now buried underneath rubble, and collapsed buildings are blocking all the roads...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Is the Originium already beginning to metastasize...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "We're almost there, but everything is blocking our way!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "If we can just...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "... Just...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "They're here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "What's here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Reunion? They caught up to us? !",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "Ugh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "There's... so many of them...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "They didn't just catch up to us...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "They're...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "--Everywhere.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "From the plaza, the streets, the buildings... and even all the ruins.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Look at those numbers. Hah...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "That explains why they weren't afraid of the Catastrophe at all, except for the ones who ended up being crushed.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Even if we assume...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "That the Catastrophe wiped out half their men--",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "They still have enough people here to kill us a dozen times over.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "Don't stop moving! We'll continue moving towards our retreat route!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "We're done for if we stop in a wide-open area! At least make it to the plaza's exit before regrouping!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Nearl...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "We have to fight. After we break through their line, we'll slip out in the ensuing chaos.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Are you sure it'll work?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "The chance is slim, but we're out of options. But...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "Even if they outnumber us ten-to-one, if they're just a bunch of thugs, we still have a chance!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "Stay calm! Prepare for battle! Defensive formations!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "...Tsk.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "With these numbers, if they wanted to take over Chernobog... they might actually be able to do it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "There are too many...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "Way too many of them..",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "Where did Reunion find all these Infected?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "We're completely surrounded...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "I never asked for this kind of respect from Reunion.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "The entire plaza... is swarming with Reunion forces!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "They've stopped moving!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Ugh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Only a single enemy is approaching our defensive line!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Why is that person walking towards us alone...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Are they sending an envoy? I don't think so...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "She...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "According to our intel, she's...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "There's something peculiar about her scent.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Nearl...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "I can't exactly put my finger on it, but...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "It's... the smell of steel and sulfur.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "As if something was burning.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "If it really is fire, then...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "All Operators... be on maximum alert.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...That person is...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Reunion's ruler...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...Talulah.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "... ...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "I reckon... her flames are powerful enough to swallow Terra entirely.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
